  "description": "Authentication and authorization against the Auderz Identity Provider, shared by every\n      microservice: IAuthorizationContext carrying the caller's subject, roles, permissions,\n      region scope, locale, culture and time zone; permission checks in two variants, one\n      returning a bool and one throwing PermissionAuthorizationException, each supporting\n      inclusive (AND), either (OR) and exclusive (NOT) permission sets; a dynamic policy provider\n      so any \"resource:action\" name works as a policy without being registered; and the exception\n      handler that turns a refusal into a translated 401 or 403.",
  "iconFile": "apple-touch-icon.png",
